{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit homes, caf\u00e9s, and more to resolve intricate cat dilemmas. Every animal has a need, every home has its quirks, and it\u2019s up to you to make sure all paws are perfectly in place!\u00a0 Between levels, return to your own cat refuge, where cats find a safe, cozy home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930380/extras/3beaf0e7bd0055d52fb34754fc92fd6f.avif?t=1759355830\" width=400 height=86 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with simple, relaxing puzzles. just you, a comfy room, and a handful of cats with surprisingly strong opinions about where they sit. As you play, the challenge grows naturally. Whether you're a curious beginner or a seasoned puzzle lover, there's something satisfying waiting for you. <br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930380/extras/8b8f79b8d86e66c2be061a08be6c39e6.poster.avif?t=1759355830\" width=780 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930380/extras/8b8f79b8d86e66c2be061a08be6c39e6.webm?t=1759355830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>&quot;Kuma Hates Yoshi but needs </i>sunlight...Maybe I can sneak him into the bedroom ?<i>&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the environment: drag furniture, add plants, knock things over (accidentally or not), and discover the cat's hilarious reactions. They have opinions, after all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930380/extras/59af4de70f84db4481c5afaa0660b2a4.poster.avif?t=1759355830\" width=780 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930380/extras/59af4de70f84db4481c5afaa0660b2a4.webm?t=1759355830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when it\u2019s time to unwind, head back to your refuge. through your hard work, unlock delightful decorations and upgrade options ! Enhance the cats lives, decorate with love, and expand your own safe space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930380/extras/35319f24d687f38fa4e8d0e9b0c5bf59.poster.avif?t=1759355830\" width=780 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930380/extras/35319f24d687f38fa4e8d0e9b0c5bf59.webm?t=1759355830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930380/extras/79efe4e142a65566345d1e9919129b59.avif?t=1759355830\" width=400 height=86 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a handful of fluffy companions, each with their own look. From sleek Sphynx to fluffy Angoras (and of course the ever-mysterious &quot;Cat.&quot; breed), everyone\u2019s represented. You might even cross paths with a Savannah or two, if you're lucky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930380/extras/97ec4b2198883df54d45a1aa84bb289f.avif?t=1759355830\" width=900 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level drops you into a new setting: a soft-lit apartment, a corner caf\u00e9, a cluttered studio with far too many plants. The scenery keeps shifting, so the puzzles stay fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wrapped in a art style hand-crafted with love, the game invites everyone in. It\u2019s simple, warm, and welcoming. The kind of space you want to curl up in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930380/extras/ea6e357a987e3f89747814f38d7dd2bb.avif?t=1759355830\" width=400 height=86 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born in the west indies, based in France, Mabouya Studio is a small indie studio trying it's best to make you smile...one whisker at a time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930380?t=1759355830","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930380?t=1759355830","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930380/dca4e2075d42cdb70698e19aa8fbcf01cd16eac2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759355830","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930380/dca4e2075d42cdb70698e19aa8fbcf01cd16eac2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759355830","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit homes, caf\u00e9s, and more to resolve intricate cat dilemmas. Every animal has a need, every home has its quirks, and it\u2019s u